{
"Items.SilkSummerDress.Desc": "A comfortable dress made of pearl-white spider-silk. Its adjustable waist sash and the allure of exposing much of one's back and shoulders combine with a flowing skirt and sleeves that fan out wide, mimicking a [if (isfeminine) {witch|mage}]'s robe. The runes swirling around the hems complete that image well."
"Items.SilkSummerDress.Long": "a spider-silk dress"
"Items.SilkSummerDress.Short": "S.Silk Dress"
}
